WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Welcome to Harbour St Tower. This is a sample induction video.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Sign in at the gate every day, and sign out when you leave.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Wear a hard hat, high-vis, safety boots and eye protection at all times.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
If the alarm sounds, stop work and go to the assembly point at the Harbour St gate.
